        "description": "Show two large overlay SENTENCE BUTTONs IMMEDIATELY. Use when SOMEONE ELSE offers the user a choice between two options — either a binary choice (\"Do you want the apple or the banana?\", or holds up two objects) OR a yes/no question. For yes/no, use the canonical `yes` / `no` SYMBOLs (e.g. option1=\"Yes|yes||Yes\", option2=\"No|no||No\") — they render with the animated yes/no icons and default green/red coloring. A \"Neither\" button is added automatically. Do NOT use for open-ended questions — use the USER RESPONSE BOARD for those.",
        "behavior": "NON_BLOCKING",
        "parametersJsonSchema": {
